  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are softened and lightly browned.",
    "Add the chopped hazelnuts and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the beef roast and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the carrots and potatoes, and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, thyme, bay leaves, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 2 hours.",
    "Remove the thyme and bay leaves, and serve hot."
  ],
